Troubleshooting Common Issues
Common Issue 1: Managed Cluster Not Joining
If a managed cluster shows as "Unknown" or fails to join:

# Check Klusterlet status on managed cluster
export KUBECONFIG=/home/student/managed-cluster-kubeconfig
oc get klusterlet -o yaml

# Verify bootstrap secret
oc get secret -n open-cluster-management-agent | grep bootstrap

# Check registration agent logs
oc logs deployment/klusterlet-registration-agent -n open-cluster-management-agent
Common Issue 2: Placement Not Working
If placement policies don't select expected clusters:

# Verify cluster labels
oc get managedclusters --show-labels

# Check placement conditions
oc describe placement <placement-name> -n <namespace>

# Examine cluster set membership
oc get managedclusterset default -o yaml
Common Issue 3: Add-on Installation Failures
If add-ons fail to install on managed clusters:

# Check add-on status
oc get managedclusteraddon -A

# Examine add-on logs
oc logs -n open-cluster-management deployment/<addon-name>-controller

# Verify add-on configuration
oc describe clustermanagementaddon <addon-name>
